//   https://github.com/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/issues/3425 (closed by PR 3426): the misaligned
//     atomicity granule PMA applies only to AMOs of Zaamo, Zabha and Zacas, not to ssamoswap, which
//     requires natural alignment.
//
