//   1. S-mode ssamoswap.w at offsets 1, 2 and 3 from a word boundary, all inside one 16-byte
//     granule: cause 6 or 7, xtval 0 or the address; rd unchanged.
//   2. RV64 ssamoswap.d at offsets 1, 4 and 7 from a doubleword boundary: cause 6 or 7.
//   3. The aligned swap at the same location succeeds (positive control).
//   4. U-mode: ssamoswap.w at offset 2 traps the same way.
//
// Approximate dynamic instruction count: 2630
//

